      "duration": 5.0
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The API is still not preserving the locked colors. I need to read the full SKILL.md documentation to understand the correct API format better. The documentation mentioned using Node.js scripts which might reveal the correct format.",
  "plan": "Let me read the full SKILL.md file and also check if there are any example scripts or documentation that shows the exact API format needed for locked colors.",
