  "analysis": "The documentation shows the Node.js script uses `--input \"44,43,44\" \"90,83,82\" N N N` format. The script likely converts this to the API format. Since I don't have the Node.js scripts, I need to find the correct API format. Let me try searching for any scripts in the system or try more API format variations.",
  "plan": "I'll search for any existing scripts in the system and also try more API format variations. The API might expect the locked colors in a specific JSON structure.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "find / -name '*.mjs' -o -name 'generate_palette*' 2>/dev/null | head -20\n",
      "duration": 3.0
